<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Mastering the power of the mind is essential to securing one’s place in the universe.-->
  <VME_PsychicFocus.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VME_PsychicFocus.description>
  <VME_PsychicFocus.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)        ->[deity0_name] gifted humanity with psychic powers so we can follow [deity0_possessive] will.-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_PsychicFocus)  ->[deity0_name] said to all the [memberNamePlural], "Your mind is your greatest boon. Learn to use it, and no enemies will stand against you."-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)           ->[memberNamePlural] built a great [altarName] on the [place_summary] [place_name], a place of learning and a school to hone one's psychic powers to exalt [deity0_name]'s will.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)        ->A coward [foeLeader], seeking to deny the will of [deity0_name], told [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] to attack [deity0_name]'s followers with insane psychic powers.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)     ->[deity0_name] blessed a [place_job] named [founderName] with [deity0_possessive] uncanny mental prowess, and none could turn away when [founder_pronoun] spoke, entranced by the wise words.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)         ->[founderName] mind-bent many of the [foeSoldiers] and coaxed them to pray to [deity0_name]. The [foeLeader] was shamed and never heard of again.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)           ->Our founder [founderName] was a psychic warrior in a forgotten, shattered star empire. [founder_pronoun] had an incredible mental discipline, that manifested in wondrous psychic powers.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_PsychicFocus)    ->[founder_pronoun] founded a prestigious martial academy where all [foeLeader_possessive] followers could learn how to hone their minds and use them as a weapon.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)         ->In all my years teaching the disciplines of the mind, I learned one lesson that is more important than anything else:-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)              ->you don't use your mind as a weapon, your mind IS the weapon. You don't just use it for offensive purposes, or it is wasted-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_PsychicFocus) ->The greatest psychic warrior ever will not be one that knows how to use these powers, but one who knows how to think before using them.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)    ->The archotechs are pure minds, pristine intellects that are so far beyond anything else as to be like gods.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)     ->Psychic powers are a gift from the archotechs. By awakening them in our minds we participate, albeit faintly, in the glory that is an archotech intellect.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_PsychicFocus) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will choose those with the greatest command over their minds, and only them will be allowed to transcend.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)     ->The spirits are the ultimate minds, and by awakening and channeling our hidden psychic potential we can commune with them.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)->[itIsSaid] we will unlock the hidden psychic potential of our minds, and use those newfound powers to venerate our beloved insects.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)->These eldritch entities are the ultimate intellects, as vast and deep as entire nebulae, their madness engulfing a thousand stars. Only by awakening and channeling our hidden psychic potential can we hope to stand against them.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)->We will awaken and channel our hidden psychic potential to unlock all these secrets, baring them for all to see.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)->We will awaken and channel our hidden psychic potential and use our destructive powers to slaughter everyone who stands in our way.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_PsychicFocus)->As you all well know, we value intelligence immensely here at the company. Therefore, those who manifest hidden psychic potential are encouraged to inform human resources as soon as possible, so they can be reassigned to a new department where they could be put at use.-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
  </VME_PsychicFocus.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_PsychicFocus.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->mental-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;强制</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->psychic-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;严格</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->metaphysical-->
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;极端</li>
    <!--EN: memeHyphenPrefix->mind-->
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;绝对真理</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->psychic power-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;高级审判官</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->mentalist-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;审判官</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->augur-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;十字军</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->seer-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;工头</li>
    <!--EN: memeMoralist->prophet-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;多合一</li>
    <!--EN: memeMoralist->clairvoyant-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;群</li>
  </VME_PsychicFocus.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: psychic focus-->
  <VME_PsychicFocus.label>暴力皈依</VME_PsychicFocus.label>
  <!--EN: People should follow royalty, and treat them with great respect.-->
  <VME_Royal.description>传播我们的信仰是我们的责任，即使是通过武力。</VME_Royal.description>
  <VME_Royal.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_Royal)        ->[deity0_name] saw that some of the [memberNamePlural] were more fit to rule than others, and spoke to them: "Why do you treat everyone equally? Some of you are born to be rulers, while others are born to be ruled".-->
    <li>creation(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name]在凡人中指定了一些十字军来执行[deity0_possessive]的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_Royal)  ->[deity0_name] said to all the [memberNamePlural]: "Honour your leaders and treat them like my heralds on the mortal world, for they are more than mere men".-->
    <li>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 对所有 [memberNamePlural] 说，“异教徒必须接受我的话，否则就会灭亡。”</li>
    <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_Royal)           ->[memberNamePlural] built a regal [altarName] on the [place_summary] [place_name], a monument to [deity0_name]'s glory.-->
    <li>intro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[memberNamePlural] 在 [place_summary] [place_name] 上建造了一个伟大的 [altarName]，因此很多人都会屈服于 [deity0_name] 的意愿。</li>
    <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_Royal)        ->Constant peasant revolts threatened the existance of [deity0_name]'s temple, and the leaders of the [memberNamePlural] decided to pacify them.-->
    <li>conflict(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 一个胆小鬼 [foeLeader] 试图否认 [deity0_name] 的意愿，告诉 [foeLeader_possessive] [foeSoldiers] 割掉任何谈论 [deity0_type] 的人的舌头。</li>
    <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_Royal)     ->[deity0_name] instructed [founderName] to put the peasants in their place, for they were theatening the lives of their betters.-->
    <li>founderJoin(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[deity0_name] 以 [deity0_possessive] 坚定的决心祝福名为 [founderName] 的 [place_job]，当 [founder_pronoun] 说话时，没有人可以转身。</li>
    <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_Royal)         ->[founderName] crushed the peasant revolts, and his royal bloodline has been blessed ever since.-->
    <li>victory(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[founderName]屠杀了许多[foeSoldiers]并残酷地折磨了幸存者，以展示[deity0_name]的力量。他们痛苦的呼喊将永远提醒我们那些否认[deity0_name]的人的命运。</li>
    <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_Royal)           ->Our founder [founderName] was a great sociologist, who saw the weak democratic systems in [founder_possessive] native world and found them incredibly inadequate. [founder_pronoun] chartered a private spaceship and left with hundreds of [founder_possessive] followers to create the ideal feudal society.-->
    <li>setup(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;我们的创始人 [founderName] 是一位伟大的革命者和天才，在 [founder_pronoun] 穿梭于各个城市之间时，改变了数千人的信仰。</li>
    <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_Royal)    ->[founderName]'s followers studied [founder_possessive] writings and created a social structure that has been stable for more than two hundred years.-->
    <li>story(uses=1,tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;信徒们在城市和机构之间流动，传播新秩序的消息并战斗反对那些不同意的人。</li>
    <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_Royal)         ->In all my years ruling over the masses, I learned one lesson that stands over all:-->
    <li>lessonIntro(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 在传播我们的理念的这些年里，我学到了一个重要的教训：</li>
    <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_Royal)              ->some people are born to be rulers, while others are born to be ruled-->
    <li>lesson(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;除了我们的真理，没有任何真理。我们不能让任何人妨碍我们。他们要么同意，要么死</li>
    <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_Royal) ->And only by honouring and obeying our noblest aristocrats can we truly build a stable society.-->
    <li>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;这就是我们需要传播、传播、传播的事实。如果有必要，可以用武力。</li>
    <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_Royal)    ->The archotechs are flawless. A perfect example of hierarchy where most live to serve the needs of the noble few.-->
    <li>archistBasis(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; Archotechs 从天空和心灵中宣布他们的存在，并且他们的存在必须成为普遍真理。</li>
    <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_Royal)     ->There is no ground for hesitation: only those truly subservient to their betters will be rewarded when the archotechs make themselves known to the rest of the Universe.-->
    <li>archistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;Archotechs 必须被服从，我们有责任让他人屈服于他们的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_Royal) ->[inTheEnd], the archotechs will allow those of noble blood to ascend, but their servants will be allowed to serve them afterwards too.-->
    <li>archistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt;[inTheEnd]，考古技术人员将向 [relic0_name] 的持有者表达他们最后的智慧。凡是不听话的人都必须被清除。</li>
    <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_Royal)     ->The spirits value those of pure blood above the rest, for those who can command others in life are also proving the strength of their spirit.-->
    <li>animistFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion) -&gt; 灵魂想要被人认识，但只与少数人交谈。我们会让任何阻碍我们的人敬畏神灵的意志。</li>
    <!--EN: serketistProphecy(tag=meme_Royal)->As ants and bees have their queens and their drones, so shall we organize our societies: one of noble blood reigning supreme over his or her subjects.-->
    <li>serketistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;[itIsSaid]我们将向他们学习，并利用这些知识来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_Royal)->Our leaders of noble blood will protect us and shield us from the cosmic insanity of these terrible beings. Only by obeying them can we hope to stay sane.-->
    <li>chthonianProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们将获得他们的可怕知识，并用它来清除宇宙中肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_Royal)->The noble blood of our leaders will allow them to see beyond the veil. Secrets that are to be forever hidden from their humble servants.-->
    <li>esotericismProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;有了这些知识，我们将比这个星球上的其他居民拥有明显的优势，并用它来清除肮脏的异教徒。</li>
    <!--EN: eschatologismFact(tag=meme_Royal)->We shall name our leader the Prince of Lies. The one who brings the end of all things.-->
    <li>eschatologismFact(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;什么都不会剩下。肮脏的异教徒将被原子火和致命疾病所清除。</li>
    <!--EN: introMemo(tag=meme_Royal)->It has recently come to my attention that some of you have been abusing the royal permits for personal gain. Let me remind you that we take appropiation of company funds as a very serious offense. Remember: none of us are noble if any of us act like peasants!-->
    <li>introMemo(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt; 如您所知，我们公司的使命太重要了，不能让其他人妨碍我们，因此我们正在准备一次敌意合并，以摆脱这些……不受欢迎的竞争对手。</li>
    <!--EN: alienistProphecy(tag=tag=meme_Royal)->We will create wondrous royal menageries with all of these creatures, a veritable display of our power and might.-->
    <li>alienistProphecy(tag=meme_ViolentConversion)-&gt;我们需要用武力传播这些生物的现实，这些生物是人类在整个环域播下的种子。</li>
  </VME_Royal.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings>
  <VME_Royal.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->kingly-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;强制</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->royal-->
    <li>memeAdjective-&gt;严格</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->monarchal-->
    <li>memeHyphenPrefix-&gt;极端</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->princely-->
    <li>memeConcept-&gt;绝对真理</li>
    <!--EN: memeAdjective->sovereign-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;高级审判官</li>
    <!--EN: memeHyphenPrefix->noble-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;审判官</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->aristocracy-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;十字军</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->nobility-->
    <li>memeMoralist-&gt;工头</li>
    <!--EN: memeConcept->blue blood-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;多合一</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->baron-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;群</li>
    <!--EN: memeLeaderNoun->count-->
    <li>memeLeaderNoun-&gt;肉体塑造者</li>
  </VME_Royal.generalRules.rulesStrings>
